# NOTE: when this file exists, `pub publish` uses it INSTEAD of `.gitignore`,
# so anything `.gitignore` excludes is not excluded from the archive. Keep the
# two lists in sync. Measured 23 Nov 2026: CLAUDE.md is in `.gitignore` yet was
# packed into the archive until it was added here.

